# Failing-first tests in tests/fm-project-capacity.test.sh, on upstream-lean: test_freed_tree_goes_to_the_highest_priority_waiter is red because a P1 that waited longer and retries first takes a freed tree from the waiting P0 (agent-config .agent-config-wnvf0: GSP P0 gsp-dc9j6-6 lost two trees on 10-29). test_later_arrival_of_one_priority_waits_behind is red because a later arrival takes the tree. test_same_second_arrivals_keep_their_order is red because a later arrival takes the tree; at this PR's first head d8821a62 it was red too, because ties within one second fell to the task id (chip's review). test_stale_waiter_stops_holding_the_line and test_waiter_lives_as_long_as_its_owner are red because a start deferred on a full pool joins no line. test_teardown_wakes_the_head_waiter_at_once is red because the head starts 3.5-6.9 s after the teardown, at its retry. All are green after this change.
pr: 196
